<BaseLayout title="Cookie policy" description="MotionHotel cookie policy template."><section class="page"><p class="eyebrow">COOKIES</p><h1>Only what is needed.</h1><p>This theme does not set non-essential cookies by default.</p></section><section class="section prose legal-prose"><p class="legal-notice">Theme template only — update this page and implement consent management before adding analytics, marketing tags, embeds or other non-essential technologies.</p><h2>Essential technologies</h2><p>The static demo site itself does not use cookies for analytics, advertising or profiling. Your hosting provider may process technically necessary data; document this in your final privacy policy.</p><h2>Optional services</h2><p>If you add analytics, a booking engine, maps, videos or social-media embeds, explain their purpose, provider, duration and legal basis here. Obtain consent where this is required by applicable law.</p><h2>Managing consent</h2><p>Describe how visitors can change or withdraw consent through the consent tool used on your production website.</p></section></BaseLayout>
